.el .ds Aq '
.TH soundcraft-cli 1  "soundcraft-cli 0.18.0 (linux x86_64)" 
.SH NAME
soundcraft\-cli \- soundcraft\-cli: SoundCraft without a window
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsoundcraft\-cli\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
soundcraft\-cli: SoundCraft without a window
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-info(1)
Print an audio file\*(Aqs format as JSON, or a .scraft session\*(Aqs summary
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-convert(1)
Convert an audio file: resample, change the bit depth, normalize
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-run(1)
Run engine commands on a new, demo or saved session
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-script(1)
Run a file of engine commands, one `ID JSON` per line
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-commands(1)
List the engine commands
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-describe(1)
Print one engine command\*(Aqs details as JSON
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-app(1)
Call a running app\*(Aqs control channel
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-mcp(1)
Serve MCP on stdin and stdout
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-parity(1)
Print the parity report (markdown)
.TP
soundcraft\-cli\-plugins(1)
List the built\-in plugins
.SH VERSION
v0.18.0 (linux x86_64)
